# CR 106.3a: Snow-Covered Island produces snow U, not plain U --
# mana-payment-resolves-snow already proves this for Snow-Covered Plains;
# here for Snow-Covered Island, a snow requirement (queue paysnow) rather than a plain one.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 U
queue paysnow U
paymanacost human S
